Notes on the module:
- Textures to supply later: `block/item_pipe` (yellow), `block/fluid_pipe` (blue), `block/energy_pipe` (red), `item/wrench`, `item/connector`. All three tiers of a kind share one texture; tier is distinguishable by a later overlay if wanted.
- Id migration is a documented static map (`IdMigration`) because no remap hook is wired in; it can be called from a `RegisterEvent`/`MissingMappingsEvent` handler or used by a data-fix script.
- The `FilterMenu` registers with a client-side factory that passes a null `PipeBlockEntity`; for the dedicated server this module needs no client screen, and a screen can be added later without changing the logic.
- `SelfTest.main()` checks face modes, redstone modes, distribution ordering, connector range rule, id migration and tier multiplier.
